    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nOffers in Excess of 245,000\n\n19 Ard Alainn is a fabulous semi-detached home that offers three bedrooms and fantastic living space in the ever popular development of Ard Alainn which comprises of just 33 homes. This impressive home has a spacious north facing back garden and is also positioned within a short walk of all amenities New Ross has to offer including schools, church, shops and sport/amenity areas. Accomodation extends to on the ground floor, entrance hall, living room, kitchen dining room, utility room and guest wc. The first floor offers three bedroom and family bathroom. There is also a good size attached garage and off street parking. This home represents superb value considering location, size and presentation. Early viewing is strongly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Porch - 1.77m x 0.7m\nTiled floor\n\nEntrance Hall - 4.2m x 1.78m\nLaminate floor, telephone point, stairs to first floor\n\nLiving Room - 4.6m x 3.3m\nLaminate floor, stove, tv point, south west facing\n\nGuest WC - 1.6m x 0.76m\nLino floor, WC, wash hand basin with tiled splachback and mirror over\n\nKitchen Dining Room - 5.5m x 3.38\nLaminate floor, fitted waist and eye level units, oven, hob, tiled splash back, plumbed for dishwasher, dual aspect windows\n\nUtility Room - 2.29m x 1.83m\nPlumbed for washing machine, rear access, waist and eye level storage\n\nLanding - 3m x 1.98m\nCarpet flooring\n\nBedroom One - 2.36m x 2.3m\nTo front, laminated floor\n\nBedroom Two - 3.7m x 3.4m\nTo front, laminate floor, built in wardrobe, telephone point\n\nBedroom Three - 3.4m x 3.34m\nLaminate floor, to rear\n\nBathroom - 2.4m x 2.2m\nLino floor, bath, Mira Elite shower, WC, wash hand basin with mirror and shaving light over\n\nOUTSIDE - \n\n\nGarage - 5.5m x 2.3m\nDouble door to front, concrete floor, ESB\n\n"
      },
